{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1260006-unofficial-poll-what-eras-do-you-want-to-see-in-the-next-dark-eras","id":1260006,"title":"Unofficial Poll!!,What Eras do you want to see in the next dark eras","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-10T12:41:47-07:00","id":1260006,"title":"Unofficial Poll!!,What Eras do you want to see in the next dark eras","content":"As a bonus pick which game line/s you want .<br /> <br /> Here\u2019s mine communist era Mongolia we here in the western world don\u2019t hear about Mongolia expect if it\u2019s about the Golden Horde . Especially not the communist era. It\u2019s a really interesting thing because Mongolia has a strong tradition with Anminism and Shamanism and during the Soviet era. All religions where oppressed. <br /> <br /> This is talked about in the really good book \u2018Tragic Spirts;Shamanism, Memory, and Gender in Contemporary Mongolia\u2019 of course I want is to focus on Werewolf and Geist dealing with the fact that the spirts are getting angry in there view a sudden lack of respect and worship I guess Geist I\u2019m here to becuase the difference between Spirts and Ghosts gets really blurry","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T15:29:41-07:00","id":1260212,"title":"","content":"I want more Dark Eras for Beast, they don't have a lot of that. As for when, somewhere between the fourth and sixth century AD in central Europe during and after the fall of the Roman Empire. This is the time where the legendary tales of Beowulf and Sigurd took place, I'm curious to see it through a Beasts perspective and to see whether these Legendary Heroes were like the complete sociopaths that they face in the modern day or if the old epics tales about their selflessness and honor actually do carry some weight. This is also the time of Attila the Hun and his legendary rampages. Is it just me that tends to think that would make an interesting Ravager?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":3742,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","user":"Iceblade44","date":". 10-12-2018, 12:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T20:00:15-07:00","id":1260237,"title":"","content":"Beast has like one dark era doesn't It?<br /> <br /> A dark era I would like is the red scare. Preferably have it be a crossover of beast and demon. I assume inguma would be having a great time in this era","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T20:32:37-07:00","id":1260239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1260006-unofficial-poll-what-eras-do-you-want-to-see-in-the-next-dark-eras?p=1260237#post1260237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beast has like one dark era doesn't It?<br /> <br /> A dark era I would like is the red scare. Preferably have it be a crossover of beast and demon. I assume inguma would be having a great time in this era</div> </div> </div> </div>Currently just Reconstruction US. Hawara and the Islamic Golden Age are both coming in Dark Eras 2 though. <br /> <br /> That said, I would be completely down for a small Dark Eras book just with Beast Eras. And I will continue to advocate that one of them be the Zanzibar Sultanate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T20:43:18-07:00","id":1260242,"title":"","content":"Islamic golden age huh. That one will be great.<br /> <br /> What's the history of Zanzibar","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T20:50:23-07:00","id":1260243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1260006-unofficial-poll-what-eras-do-you-want-to-see-in-the-next-dark-eras?p=1260242#post1260242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Islamic golden age huh. That one will be great.<br /> <br /> What's the history of Zanzibar</div> </div> </div> </div>Finger crossed!<br /> <br /> Basically, what happened is that the Sultans of Oman (in Arabia) conquered the islands Zanzibar (off the Swahili coast of southeast Africa), setting up a small but influential trading empire, particularly in the slave trade. Zanzibar broke away midway through the Nineteenth century, then only a few decades later, German East Africa was proclaimed on the mainland. You end up with many, many different cultures in the region, as well as a lot of mystique around the islands themselves. Even today, jinn are said to haunt the streets of Zanzibar at night, and healers and sorcerers make deals with them to work their magic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T21:02:42-07:00","id":1260246,"title":"","content":"On Beast, still promoting Beast/Changeling Book of Invasions Ireland, with the Fomorian Beasts against the God-Heroes, the Tuatha de Danaan.<br /> <br /> Also I still think Changeling/Werewolf French Resistance would be rad.<br /> <br /> Also Geist/Demon...really, any war involving Christianity, but I've got a bias towards the Hundred Years War.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-12-2018, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-11T21:46:56-07:00","id":1260249,"title":"","content":"I'm glad we got Werewolf in the Western Front, but could still go for Forsaken in Vietnam.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T05:14:27-07:00","id":1260270,"title":"","content":"There\u2019s. Actually a comic called Namwolf which is about a guy who experiences his first change while drafted in Vietnam <br /> <div cl